#. アタシは
#. <CLT 9>殺してない<CLT>よーん！
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Sorry, but <CLT 9>I didn't kill anyone<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな言葉を
#. 誰が信じると思う？
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You say that, but do you\n"
"really expect any of us to believe it?"
msgstr ""

#. アリバイでもあれば別ですが…
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Perhaps if you had an alibi,\n"
"that would change things..."
msgstr ""

#. アリバイだって！
#. なんかそれっぽい！
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ohh, an alibi, huh? Now we're talkin'!"
msgstr ""

#. 今回の殺人と過去のお前の事件…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When you compare your past\n"
"murders to this incident..."
msgstr ""

#. 完全に<CLT 9>手口が一致<CLT>している。
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...<CLT 9>the modus operandi matches<CLT> \n"
"completely."
msgstr ""

#. それ以上の根拠はあるまい。
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What more proof do we need?"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeeehahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. 諦めろ…犯人はお前だ。
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Give it up. You killed her."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>いやいやいや…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Wrong, wrong, wrong!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>説得力ない…<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>You're gonna have to do better than that...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうだそうだ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's right!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ちなみにアリバイとは…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>So what about the alibi?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>現場不在証明…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>The alibi...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>つまり、事件当時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>When the murder took place...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>その場にいなかった。<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>I wasn't there!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>…と言う証明です。<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's what I'm trying to tell you...!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>って誰も聞いてませんな。<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>No one's listening...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
